# Module layout

SSOT: [`docs/standards/modules-and-boundaries.md`](../../docs/standards/modules-and-boundaries.md).
Match vendored Effect (`repos/effect/packages/effect`).

- One public module = one `PascalCase.ts`, flat exports (`import * as Name`).
- No object-as-namespace public surface. No `*Contract` / `*Namespace` public files.
- Heavy impl → `src/internal/<camelCase>.ts` (name-mirrored); no app imports; no subpath into `internal/`.
- Public = apps import; `internal/` = package-only. Storage facets (if any) → `src/store/` + `store/<Domain>` subpath.
